{
  "title": "ISic003390. Attic decree",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Giorgia Capra, Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09, Magazzino B</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Δεινίας Κηφισοδότου Βουτάδης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δεινίας\">Δεινίας</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Κηφισοδότου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Κηφισοδότου\">Κηφ[ισο]δότου</span></span> Βουτ̣άδη[ς]</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>θεσμοθετήσα[ς ἐπὶ] <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φειδοστράτου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φειδοστράτου\">Φειδοστράτο[υ]</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ἄ[ρ]χον[τ]ο[ς ἀ]νέθηκεν <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[ἡ βουλή] ὁ δῆμος </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Giorgia Capra, Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09, Magazzino B</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Δεινίας Κηφισοδότου Βουτάδης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δεινίας\">ΔΕΙΝΙΑΣ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Κηφισοδότου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Κηφισοδότου\">ΚΗΦ[...]ΔΟΤΟΥ</span></span>ΒΟΥ.ΑΔΗ[.]</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>ΘΕΣΜΟΘΕΤΗΣΑ[....]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φειδοστράτου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φειδοστράτου\">ΦΕΙΔΟΣΤΡΑΤΟ[.]</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>Α[.]ΧΟΝ[.]Ο[..]ΝΕΘΗΚΕΝ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[......]ΟΔΗΜΟΣ</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic003390_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003390.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003390_detail1_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390_detail1_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003390_detail1.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390_detail1-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003390_detail2_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390_detail2_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003390_detail2.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-12\" src=\"ISic003390_detail2-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text from autopsy</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\" https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1030-5679\">Giorgia Capra</a></p>  <p>Deinias son of Kephisodotos of Boutadai, who was thesmothete when Pheidostratos was archon, dedicated this. (In crown, on the left) The Council. (In crown, on the right) The People.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\" https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1030-5679\">Giorgia Capra</a></p>  <p>Deinias figlio di Kephisodotos di Boutadai, che era tesmoteta durante l'arcontato di Pheidostratos, dedicò questo. (In corona, a sinistra) Il consiglio. (In corona, a destra) Il popolo.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 02/03(2).3.1.2855 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000420\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000420</a>  </li><li> 02/03(3).4.1.99 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000413\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000413</a>  </li><li> Schubring 1861-1867 672 no. 7, tab. no.7 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001601\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001601</a></li><li> Libertini 1929 121 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001872\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001872</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1965 205 tav. LXXV.1 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1-3  10-15  Line 4  5-6  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
